<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eurīpus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-os</span></b> ), i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔριπος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a narrow channel</i>, <i>strait.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen., <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Mur. 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 23, 26, § 99</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">2, 97, 100, §
				219</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In partic.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Eurīpus</span></b> , i, m., =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὔριπος</span>, <i>the
				channel between Boeotia and Euboea</i>, now <i>Egripo</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12,
				21, § 63</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 10, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 28, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 5,
				235 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a canal</i>, <i>conduit</i>, <i>aqueduct.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ductus aquarum, quos isti nilos et euripos
					vocant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 2, 1, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Front.
				Aquaed. 84</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 83</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 10,
				11, § 63</span></i>; <i><span class="en">36, 15, 24, §
			123</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 1, 3 al.</span></i>—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> In partic., <i>the trench that ran round the Roman circus</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 39</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 8, 7,
				7, § 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Lampr. Heliog.
				23</span></i>; cf. Smith's Antiq. p. 53 a.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
